What the figures suggest
•Payment activity is embedded in everyday commerce and financial routines.
•Agent and merchant infrastructure remains commercially important alongside app-based banking.
•Platforms must balance convenience and incentives with trust, service reliability, fraud protection and support.
•Scale alone does not establish preference, satisfaction or retention; these require separate evidence.
