COMPETITIVE OVERLAP
All three compete across payment convenience, digital
access, transaction confidence and value. Merchant
products and consumer financial services increasingly
overlap. This convergence raises the cost of relying on
functional features alone as differentiation.
OBSERVED DISTINCTION
Moniepoint’s public narrative is more explicitly
merchant/business-led; OPay foregrounds broad
financial utility and affordability; PalmPay makes
rewards, savings and everyday value highly visible.
These describe emphasis, not exclusive ownership of
a feature or audience.
