MARKET INTELLIGENCE  /  NIGERIA FINTECHCOMPETITIVE & POSITIONING REVIEW
Independent desk research6
Market-level opportunity themes
Reliability as a lived experience. Success is only part
of perceived reliability; clear status, recovery and
support during failures may matter too.
Merchant economics. Merchants may evaluate fees,
settlement, uptime, support, working capital and tool
fit—not simply terminal availability.
Trust and service recovery. Security claims need
accessible help, clear disputes and timely resolution.
Incentive fatigue. Rewards may encourage trial, but
sustained use could depend on utility and service
quality.
Segment-specific communication. A merchant, student and frequent bill payer may need different reasons to choose
the same platform.
VALIDATION REQUIRED
These are informed hypotheses, not confirmed customer pain points. Test them with interviews, review coding,
surveys, app journey checks and segment-level behavioural data.
